  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A creamy eyeliner that gives full coverage with one swipe and sets to a bulletproof finish.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This eyeliner has the highest concentration of pigment in a soft base for full payoff and extended wear in one swipe. It provides the glide and the coverage of a liquid in pencil form.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Twist up and apply liner as desired. <br>-Be sure to replace cap immediately after use.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Isododécaane, triméthylsilo, diméthicone, cire synthétique, cire d'abeille synthétique, Acétate de tocophéryle, phénoxyéthanol, Caprylyl glycol, éthylhexylglycérine, hexylène glycol. Peut contenir : Ci 77499 oxydes de fer, ci 16035 Rouge 40, ci 42090 Bleu 1, Ci77742 Violet manganèse.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A creamy eyeliner that gives full coverage with one swipe and sets to a bulletproof finish.<br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, and contains less than one percent synthetic fragrance. It is also vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> This eyeliner has the highest concentration of pigment in a soft base for full payoff and extended wear in one swipe. It provides the glide and the coverage of a liquid in pencil form.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Twist up and apply liner as desired. <br>-Be sure to replace cap immediately after use.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Isododécaane, triméthylsilo, diméthicone, cire synthétique, cire d'abeille synthétique, Acétate de tocophéryle, phénoxyéthanol, Caprylyl glycol, éthylhexylglycérine, hexylène glycol. Peut contenir : Ci 77499 oxydes de fer, ci 16035 Rouge 40, ci 42090 Bleu 1, Ci77742 Violet manganèse.</div></details>",
